18	
19	  /// Atomically validates the shop and inventory, creates the order row, and
20	  /// reserves stock in `inventory_reservations` — all in one Postgres transaction
21	  /// via RPC. Inventory is decremented later by `confirm_order_inventory` when
22	  /// the Stripe webhook confirms payment. Returns the new order id.
23	  Future<String> insertPendingOrder({
24	    required String buyerId,
